or product planning\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-01T16:25:00Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"把新版目標架構寫清楚，讓 OpenClaw、Evolution Plane、Research Plane 與 LEAN 的責任分工有共同北極星。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ARC-002\",\n      \"title\": \"Publish epic roadmap aligned to target architecture\",\n      \"phase\": \"Architecture\",\n      \"owner\": \"Codex\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"ARC-001\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"ROADMAP.md\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"epics sequenced\",\n        \"ownership proposed\",\n        \"immediate next moves listed\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Published epic roadmap that turns the target architecture into sequenced delivery slices and ownership lanes\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-01T06:26:52Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"把目標架構拆成可落地的 Epic 與任務序列，讓後續可以照依賴順序逐步實作。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"EX-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Define artifact loader contract for paper and live execution\",\n      \"phase\": \"Epic A\",\n      \"owner\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Claude\",\n      \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"P2-001\",\n        \"P3-001\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"services/execution/artifact-loader/contract.md\",\n        \"services/execution/artifact-loader/artifact_metadata_schema.json\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"paper and live loader behavior documented\",\n        \"artifact metadata contract defined\",\n        \"promotion state checks specified\",\n        \"[CODEX NOTE] artifact loader must use LEAN Object Store (ObjectStore.Save/Read) as the transport between registry and LEAN runtime — direct file injection or GCS reads bypassing LEAN data provider are not acceptable\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Resetting status per AUD-CLAUDE-001: contract is done but implementation is missing. Re-evaluating LEAN native bridge.\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-02T18:00:00Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"定義 artifact loader 契約，確保 LEAN 只會透過受治理的 artifact 與 Object Store 載入 paper/live 可執行內容。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"OC-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Define OpenClaw tool permission model with allowlist and denylist\",\n      \"phase\": \"Epic B\",\n      \"owner\": \"Codex\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Claude\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"P4-001\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"services/control-plane/permissions/\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"tool policy model defined\",\n        \"persona-scoped allowlist and denylist documented\",\n        \"approval hooks identified\",\n        \"[CODEX NOTE] any tool that calls LEAN directly must be restricted to paper/backtest context only in the permission model — live execution must always flow through REG → SIG → L, never through a direct O → L tool call\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"OC-001 APPROVED for v1 lock. Review written at services/control-plane/permissions/review_oc001_claude.md. Key: deny-first model + 6 mandatory deny rules + approval hooks all aligned with router v1. Two minor open items (allow_with_approval not in schema effect enum; promotion-state not checked at router layer) documented but do not block v1.\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-02T04:20:37Z\",\n      \"review_notes_zh\": [\n        \"審查通過：deny-first 模型、強制 deny 規則與 approval hook 都已和 Router v1 對齊。\",\n        \"後續只需追蹤兩個 minor open items：policy schema 是否要直接表達 allow_with_approval，以及 promotion-state 是否要在 router 層做二次確認。\"\n      ],\n      \"review_file\": \"services/control-plane/permissions/review_oc001_claude.md\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"定義 OpenClaw 的工具權限模型，用 allowlist/denylist 把哪些 persona、channel、cron 能做哪些事鎖清楚。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"OC-002\",\n      \"title\": \"Implement OpenClaw cron workflows for ingest, review, retrain, and deploy\",\n      \"phase\": \"Epic B\",\n      \"owner\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Claude\",\n      \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"OC-001\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"services/control-plane/cron/\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"ingest workflow defined\",\n        \"review and retrain workflow defined\",\n        \"deploy workflow references promotion gate\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Defining workflow entrypoints and mapping StrategySpec to OpenClaw workflow parameters.\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-02T17:30:00Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"把 ingest、review、retrain、deploy 做成 cron workflow，讓研究、訓練與部署能分權且可追蹤。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"OC-003\",\n      \"title\": \"Define OpenClaw strategy spec and workflow handoff objects\",\n      \"phase\": \"Epic B\",\n      \"owner\": \"Codex\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Claude\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"P4-001\",\n        \"OC-001\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"services/control-plane/specs/\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"StrategySpec documented\",\n        \"handoff object schema defined\",\n        \"registry-ready fields included\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"OC-003 APPROVED for v1 lock. Review at services/control-plane/specs/review_oc003_claude.md. StrategySpec boundary correct (no execution detail leak), governance_context aligned with OC-001/P4-001, registry_hints not over-coupled to storage. Two minor open items: oneOf discriminator clarity in workflow_handoff schema, and from_stage/to_stage should eventually be enum-constrained.\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-02T05:37:22Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"定義 OpenClaw 的策略規格與交接物件，讓 orchestration 輸出可以被 registry、research 與 execution 穩定接手。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"REG-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Define strategy and model registry contract\",\n      \"phase\": \"Epic C\",\n      \"owner\": \"Codex\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"P4-001\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"services/registry/contract.md\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"registry object model defined\",\n        \"version and lineage fields defined\",\n        \"artifact lifecycle states documented\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Started aligning REG-001 with EX-001 Object Store metadata so registry projection and loader rejection rules share one governed contract.\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-02T00:55:01Z\",\n      \"review_notes_zh\": [\n        \"已開始吸收 EX-001 的 Object Store metadata 要求，接下來要鎖定 execution projection 與 loader rejection semantics。\"\n      ],\n      \"summary_zh\": \"定義策略與模型 registry 契約，包含版本、生命週期、lineage、checksum 與 rollback 所需欄位。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"REG-002\",\n      \"title\": \"Implement candidate, paper, and live promotion gate\",\n      \"phase\": \"Epic C\",\n      \"owner\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Claude\",\n      \"status\": \"review\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"REG-001\",\n        \"EX-001\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"services/registry/promotion/gate.py\",\n        \"services/registry/promotion/cli.py\",\n        \"services/registry/promotion/README.md\",\n        \"services/registry/promotion/smoke_test_gate.py\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"candidate/paper/live states enforced\",\n        \"promotion checks documented\",\n        \"deployment path consumes promotion state\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Logic, CLI, and smoke test complete. Relocated to services/. Ready for review.\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-02T18:00:00Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"實作 candidate -> paper -> live 的 promotion gate，避免 persona 或工具直接把未批准內容推進 live。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"AUD-GEMINI-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Audit Gemini tasks against Upstream OSS Integration model\",\n      \"phase\": \"Architecture\",\n      \"owner\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Codex\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"depend