todo\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"OC-002\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"services/research/ingest/\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"ingestion workflow defined\",\n        \"source normalization rules documented\",\n        \"raw research kept outside live path\",\n        \"[CODEX NOTE] ingestion sources must use structured APIs only: OpenAlex API for academic papers, GitHub REST API + repository contents endpoints for code repos — general web scraping is not acceptable\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Define governed ingestion so OpenClaw can discover research without free-roaming live changes\",\n      \"last_update\": null,\n      \"summary_zh\": \"建立研究素材 ingestion workflow，讓 OpenClaw 可以透過受控 API 管道發現論文、repo 與研究筆記。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"RS-002\",\n      \"title\": \"Normalize discovered material into StrategySpec\",\n      \"phase\": \"Epic E\",\n      \"owner\": \"Codex\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"status\": \"todo\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"RS-001\",\n        \"OC-003\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"services/research/strategy-spec/\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"StrategySpec schema defined\",\n        \"research material normalization rules documented\",\n        \"registry-ready fields included\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Turn discovered research into normalized StrategySpec objects before replication\",\n      \"last_update\": null,\n      \"summary_zh\": \"把蒐集到的研究素材正規化成 StrategySpec，讓後續 replication、registry 與 execution 都吃同一種規格。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"RS-003\",\n      \"title\": \"Run first-pass replication gate before registry admission\",\n      \"phase\": \"Epic E\",\n      \"owner\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Claude\",\n      \"status\": \"todo\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"RS-002\",\n        \"REG-001\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"services/research/replication/\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n